        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Los_Molinos%2C_California"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Historic Sanborn Fire Insurance Maps from 1914 show the town’s early layout, including downtown businesses and schools.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
