      ],
      "source": "https://hometownhistorymaps.com/pages/history-of-los-molinos-california"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Tehama County Museum, housed in an 1859 Masonic Lodge that once served as a schoolhouse, opened its doors in 1980.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
